  "releaseNotes": "1.4.0 — tracks PostQuantum.FileEncryption 1.4.0 in lockstep; no changes to signing behavior or the .sig sidecar format (v1, docs/SIGNATURE-FORMAT.md). Binary-compatibility validation against the published 1.3.0 baseline is now enabled for this package. No change to the .pqfe v2 container format, which remains FROZEN for the 1.x line. See CHANGELOG.md.",
